// Verb semantics (2026-08-10): `move N from <non-positional>` prompts the
// player to pick exactly N cards (min=max=N).
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location Hand on all
location Discard on table
location Deck on table

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three, Four, Five) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal 3 from Deck private to Hand of P:P1
  move 2 from Hand of P:P1 private to Discard
  end stage
}
